// The edge of the world; the camera never pans past it.
//
// Every `*.ron` in a mod folder is the same optional-everything file, so the
// split across world/lands/buildings/... is documentation, not schema. A mod
// can override just this by shipping a folder with one file exactly like it.
// (`*.state.ron` is the exception — that's the mutable half; see
// start.state.ron.)
(
    border: (x0: 0, y0: 40, x1: 860, y1: 540),
)
